WEBVTT

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:09.690
What's happening?!

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.770
Where the heck is Pecorine?

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.680
Pecorine...

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:35.170
Welcome to my Landosol Castle,

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:38.560
Princess Eustiana.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:45.270
It's been a long time, Princess.

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:49.760
How has your journey been going 
since you fled this castle?

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:51.660
Have you gotten lonely?

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:55.780
<b></b>Menu 5 <b>  Light and Darkness as One</b> 
~Churrasco of Indecision and Resolve~

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:53.840
Or perhaps it was painful?

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:56.120
Considering...

00:00:57.260 --> 00:01:01.190
you had the power to teleport me here,

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.130
surely you know that much about me?

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.930
You aren't scared at all, are you?

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:11.630
I brought you here today to assess you.

00:01:11.630 --> 00:01:13.630
To find out...

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:19.050
just how sweet a fruit 
your soul has grown into.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.380
Detective... Detective...

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:28.910
I want to be a great detective.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:39.000
Damn it!

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.020
There's still the Shadow horde, too,

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:44.800
but we really gotta stop that golem.

00:01:47.040 --> 00:01:48.600
Miss Pecorine...

00:01:49.010 --> 00:01:52.180
You know there's no way she'd 
kick the bucket that easily.

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.180
I know she's all right.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:58.380
This place will be crushed 
by the golem soon.

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:01.210
Assistant, hurry and get Kiiri to a safe—

00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.150
Scared... I'm scared...

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:20.190
Are you okay, Kiiri?

00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:21.950
This way!

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:27.630
Assistant?

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.330
Sir? Sir!

00:02:35.710 --> 00:02:38.060
Just look at this flower bed.

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:42.660
Everyone is on alert, but no one 
can find the one who ransacked it.

00:02:42.660 --> 00:02:46.800
We'll just have to catch 
the culprit ourselves!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.930
Hey, are you listening to me? Sir!

00:02:53.890 --> 00:02:55.910
Hi. Long time no see.

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:01.540
Sorry. I can't let you see this memory yet.

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.460
Memory?

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:09.830
The things you call Shadows are basically 
bugs that occur in this world.

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:15.810
They're like viruses that aren't 
native to the human body,

00:03:15.810 --> 00:03:20.350
so they should have been eliminated 
by this world's immune system.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.820
But because of a certain someone,

00:03:23.820 --> 00:03:28.470
those viruses are being used 
rather than destroyed.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:30.290
Be careful.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.670
The battle is still ongoing.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.380
You okay, Assistant?

00:03:43.380 --> 00:03:45.310
You froze up for a second!

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:48.170
Yeah!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.850
Bugs occurring in the world?

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.210
I see.

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.860
If you think about the descriptions 
people have reported,

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:59.890
you could certainly view them that way.

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.340
But...

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:05.410
Why would the Shadows want Kiiri?

00:04:05.920 --> 00:04:08.510
Detective, I'm scared.

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:18.880
<i>That was...</i>

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.320
<i>definitely teleportation.</i>

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:25.780
<i>But the only one who can use that is...</i>

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:28.220
Karyl!

00:04:32.660 --> 00:04:34.020
Pecorine...

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:37.530
That way! Come on!

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:01.820
They're on the move!

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:05.830
It looks like my hypothesis was right.

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:09.330
They're drawn to Kiiri, 
so they've changed direction.

00:05:09.610 --> 00:05:11.340
Assistant's information was correct.

00:05:11.340 --> 00:05:15.820
The Shadows move toward a single 
objective as a swarm, like army ants.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:19.120
Since Kiiri has developed 
consciousness, however fragile,

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:23.330
she must be like a faintly 
glowing light to the Shadows.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.330
But still...

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:28.650
Can we subject Kiiri to 
such a dangerous plan?

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:36.960
I want... to be like you, Great Detective.

00:05:36.960 --> 00:05:39.350
I want to do my best to help everyone.

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:44.580
All right. We'll keep you safe, 
no matter what.

00:05:44.580 --> 00:05:46.150
Just don't be too reckless.

00:05:46.820 --> 00:05:49.350
Thank you, Great Detective!

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:55.050
It looks like you have a new assistant.

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:56.740
I'll do my best!

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:06.500
Kiiri! Don't get too far ahead of us.

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:10.870
I'll do my best! I'll be 
a great detective, too!

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.360
Are you okay, Kiiri?

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:30.160
Yes.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:33.610
Thank you, sir.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:37.490
It's within sight now.

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:39.760
This is Castalia Lake.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:49.470
This castle, this kingdom,

00:06:49.920 --> 00:06:55.430
and your name are all no more 
than offerings to me, your god.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:58.780
Same for the very blood in your veins.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:00.800
What is...

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:04.340
What is it you hope to accomplish?

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:07.300
If you want to rule Landosol as its king,

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:09.690
then please listen more 
to what your people say!

00:07:10.100 --> 00:07:13.020
So that they can all eat 
their meals with a smile!

00:07:14.490 --> 00:07:15.890
Shall we...

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.460
have a little chat?

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:25.960
It was no mere coincidence that 
I took your name, your status,

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:28.120
and the very existence of Eustiana.

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:30.340
It was an inevitability...

00:07:31.270 --> 00:07:34.230
in this world overrun by mistakes.

00:07:37.820 --> 00:07:40.930
Those eyes of yours, so filled 
with determination...

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:42.240
I remember that look.

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:47.920
And I remember your look 
of despair, as well.

00:07:47.920 --> 00:07:51.520
You're afraid of being 
forgotten, aren't you?

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.360
Yes, that's the look.

00:07:57.030 --> 00:08:01.670
You have met many people since you 
fled this castle, haven't you?

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:05.380
You even formed a guild.

00:08:05.380 --> 00:08:08.620
Were you happy? Was it fun?

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:15.120
Silly girl, thinking you 
can just make friends...

00:08:15.560 --> 00:08:18.500
when you're just going 
to be forgotten again.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:29.730
Ah, what a fantastic expression.

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:33.530
That's just how my fruits ought to be.

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:37.530
So tasty-looking.

00:08:40.130 --> 00:08:41.750
It's working!

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:44.510
They're heading straight toward us!

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:46.660
Once we've lured them into the lake,

00:08:46.660 --> 00:08:50.070
we'll use Kokkoro's glider to get 
back to Makoto and the others.

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:50.800
Right.

00:08:58.420 --> 00:09:00.860
Yes! It worked!

00:09:01.210 --> 00:09:02.770
All thanks to you, Kiiri!

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:09.320
Yeah!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.780
All right, everyone, 
let's get away from here!

00:09:17.730 --> 00:09:19.700
Quickly, everyone!

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:33.960
Kiiri?!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.570
This can't be...

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.200
What on earth was that light?

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:45.730
Her body is...

00:09:56.580 --> 00:09:57.680
Assistant?

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.650
My lord!

00:10:16.890 --> 00:10:18.140
Oh, no...

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:24.040
They're headed this way now!

00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:25.820
What in the world...

00:10:26.210 --> 00:10:29.360
We don't have time to be 
confused! Intercept them!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:33.840
I don't want... to go away...

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:39.120
It's okay.

00:10:40.310 --> 00:10:42.320
Kiiri won't go away.

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.710
Something is different...

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:50.420
My lord, any further and you'll...

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:57.590
Kiiri! Kiiri!

00:10:58.890 --> 00:11:01.680
Don't be naughty anymore, okay?

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:04.540
It looks like we've solved the case.

00:11:04.540 --> 00:11:09.300
Who would have thought the one who wrecked 
the flower bed was a cute kitty like this.

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:13.050
We were even able to take in Kiiri 
when she was about to be disposed of.

00:11:13.050 --> 00:11:15.930
For great detectives, 
there could be no greater reward!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:22.280
You're...

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:28.100
Thank you...

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:32.220
For feeling sad to say goodbye to me...

00:11:33.280 --> 00:11:37.940
For wishing that I could 
continue to exist...

00:11:40.730 --> 00:11:48.100
I wanted to spend more time 
with you and the detective...

00:12:01.760 --> 00:12:05.190
Calm down, Yuuki! 
Don't act rashly in this state!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.090
No! Any more, and...

00:12:14.270 --> 00:12:15.840
What's going on?

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:18.680
Guess we made it in time, huh?

00:12:22.450 --> 00:12:24.790
Oh. So it was you...

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:28.460
Queen Labyrinth.

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:38.230
We managed to preserve Kiiri's 
consciousness, at least.

00:12:39.160 --> 00:12:41.720
The destruction of her body 
can't be avoided, though,

00:12:41.720 --> 00:12:43.710
due to this world's self-cleansing function.

00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:48.120
I'll do my best to keep her safe 
until everything is set free,

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:52.390
so that Yuuki and his friends 
can see her again someday.

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:56.010
Since the Shadows are bugs 
occurring this world,

00:12:56.010 --> 00:12:58.520
even if one of them acquires a living body

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:00.960
it doesn't house a soul.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:03.640
It's basically a mirror image,

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:06.660
or perhaps a broken record;

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:09.680
a hollow being that can do 
nothing but repeat things.

00:13:10.130 --> 00:13:13.780
But if that image develops a consciousness,

00:13:13.780 --> 00:13:15.200
it's a different story.

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:18.270
You could even call it just another human.

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:22.670
Still, this world won't allow

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.940
two of the same human to exist.

00:13:27.460 --> 00:13:28.470
Especially...

00:13:29.190 --> 00:13:32.660
for what that boy is to this world.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:36.140
Kiiri...

00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:40.780
My Shadow, who had the same face as me...

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.470
Everyone...

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.710
Let's go! We can still make it in time!

00:13:52.650 --> 00:13:54.370
We can't give up!

00:13:57.000 --> 00:14:00.620
I swear I will find out who erased you.

00:14:04.730 --> 00:14:07.240
Watch me, Kiiri.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:11.340
Let's go!

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:13.500
Yeah!

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:16.240
Roger that, Assistant!

00:14:21.450 --> 00:14:23.560
Putting others first...

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:25.890
A choice truly worthy of him.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:30.010
Should you be the one saying that?

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:33.630
Sorry.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:35.290
It's fine.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:38.470
It only makes sense that 
you'd say that to me.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:42.250
I'm the one who dragged 
him into this, after all.

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:46.740
Still, I can't help wishing.

00:14:47.290 --> 00:14:49.490
That this world he chose,

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:55.610
this world that chose to restore 
bonds that had been broken,

00:14:56.050 --> 00:14:57.620
will prove meaningful.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:02.630
My lord!

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:10.660
No... No!

00:15:12.130 --> 00:15:13.600
My lord!

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:15.950
Please, stay with us!

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:18.090
I'll use healing magic now!

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:20.390
Hang in there, little brother!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.670
Yuuki!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:25.800
The blood...

00:15:27.340 --> 00:15:28.570
Stop!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.040
Please stop!

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.040
Are you ready?

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:38.780
You have options.

00:15:39.560 --> 00:15:41.550
You can make a choice.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:45.160
Will you return to that hopeless 
battle with no hope of salvation

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:47.310
and protect the bonds you have now,

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.400
or will you cast your eyes slightly 
downward and start anew?

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:54.590
So long as you remain who you are,

00:15:54.590 --> 00:15:57.490
even if the bonds you have now are lost,

00:15:57.490 --> 00:15:59.680
you have a chance to start over again.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.720
A chance to reform your 
bonds with all of them.

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:07.000
There's more than just this path

00:16:07.000 --> 00:16:09.860
of danger and hardship with 
no hope of salvation.

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:13.610
There is another path you can take.

00:16:22.770 --> 00:16:25.270
Okay. I understand.

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:31.130
No matter what the world looks like 
the next time you open your eyes,

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.520
you are not at fault in any way.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:44.320
Don't...

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.000
Don't ever forget that.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:43.520
Yuuki!

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.220
I want to believe...

00:17:48.790 --> 00:17:50.820
In that boy's courage.

00:17:51.730 --> 00:17:52.960
His bonds.

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:56.420
And I want to believe my Princess Knight

00:17:56.420 --> 00:17:59.710
will undoubtedly save 
everyone from this world.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:24.320
You stole everything from me.

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:28.560
I can neither forgive nor 
affirm what you've done.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:34.250
But simply hating and disavowing each 
other all the time makes me too sad.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.490
So...

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.760
Let's eat a meal together.

00:18:45.760 --> 00:18:49.980
If we can talk to each other 
while sharing a meal,

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.580
maybe I'll be able to understand 
you a little better.

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:55.640
That won't work.

00:18:56.490 --> 00:19:01.280
Everything you are belongs to me, Eustiana.

00:19:02.270 --> 00:19:03.280
No.

00:19:04.360 --> 00:19:07.630
My name is Pecorine now.

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.590
But still, I will get it all back!

00:19:11.190 --> 00:19:13.600
The name you stole from me,

00:19:14.180 --> 00:19:15.530
and this kingdom, too!

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.200
I see.

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:26.010
The fruit is not quite ripe yet.

00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:29.470
I love that look on your face.

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:32.340
Deepen your bonds further.

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:36.380
That will lead to even deeper despair.

00:19:37.640 --> 00:19:38.870
And then...

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:42.620
I will take everything 
away from you for good.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.350
That's...

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:54.910
Pecorine!

00:19:54.910 --> 00:19:56.380
Miss Pecorine!

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:01.550
Yes! I'll do it!

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:04.340
I'll overcome any hardship 
that comes my way,

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:07.140
to make sure nothing will 
ever be taken from me again!

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:44.960
Peco!

00:20:53.660 --> 00:21:00.070
Princess Strike!

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:07.150
Go!

00:21:06.350 --> 00:21:10.270
Ya can't lose!

00:21:12.590 --> 00:21:15.000
You'd better win, Pecorine!

00:21:15.320 --> 00:21:19.870
Win and come back to us!

00:21:36.670 --> 00:21:38.490
Is it over?

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:46.210
Peco!

00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:48.780
Miss Pecorine!

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:55.870
Pecorine...

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:15.050
I'm starving.

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:18.670
For crying out loud...

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:23.410
Don't make us worry like that, Dumborine!

00:22:25.600 --> 00:22:26.740
Miss Karyl!

00:22:28.340 --> 00:22:30.130
Ow...

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:47.760
I'm back.

00:22:54.360 --> 00:22:55.420
Dummy.

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:02.070
Welcome back.

00:23:27.110 --> 00:23:28.590
This just...

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:32.470
became rather troublesome.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:40.010
Menu 6 <b> Code Name: Monika 
 ~Bouillabaisse Is Best Enjoyed Hot~</b>
